    "detailed_description": "In Polyphony, a world governed by music, Hip Hop was once a great culture that thrived and existed for the benefit of commoners and those who were impoverished. However, soon after the &quot;Golden Age,&quot; The Evil Music Industry took over the world's music and forced those who practiced the 4 elements of Hip Hop into hiding for many years. Meanwhile, mysterious monsters known as &quot;The Darkness&quot; begin to appear around the world without explanation...<br><br>Join BeNeVoLeNcE, Mega Ran and friends on their quest to restore the 4 Elements of Hip-Hop and save the world from the evil Music Industry and the Darkness. The story of TOTE follows their adventures as they journey around the musical world of Polyphony!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/b02800a4d279431aec76c97dce73d3b8.webp?t=1732379290\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/2981e944671784c158de277e61b6a22b.poster.avif?t=1732379290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/2981e944671784c158de277e61b6a22b.webm?t=1732379290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/2981e944671784c158de277e61b6a22b.mp4?t=1732379290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fast-paced, hack and slash action combat for up to 4 players!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/765758355fb1197146072679014246ee.webp?t=1732379290\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/85216a211c1f33e877a7c8615da7c95e.poster.avif?t=1732379290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/85216a211c1f33e877a7c8615da7c95e.webm?t=1732379290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/85216a211c1f33e877a7c8615da7c95e.mp4?t=1732379290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A non-rhythm based game that features music-based puzzles where changing the background music alters environments!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/9bc4db9b3d42dcc3c7f45fb236a2fedf.webp?t=1732379290\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/115c9259d0a8d461115088a403b64a1a.poster.avif?t=1732379290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/115c9259d0a8d461115088a403b64a1a.webm?t=1732379290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/115c9259d0a8d461115088a403b64a1a.mp4?t=1732379290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose to follow the story of BeNeVoLeNcE or the story of Mega Ran across a story-rich campaign that can take from 15 - 60 hours!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/690f0a8860bf39e8cea9592a75925c63.webp?t=1732379290\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/e9f611a0adb53e3036b9e9beb35af9af.poster.avif?t=1732379290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/e9f611a0adb53e3036b9e9beb35af9af.webm?t=1732379290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/e9f611a0adb53e3036b9e9beb35af9af.mp4?t=1732379290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore Polyphony, a vast, modernistic fantasy world where music empowers the planet. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/32f8530edd36ce88ac5f61c31b647add.webp?t=1732379290\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/94994e64f8e9c8f6a5581198151ccbb1.poster.avif?t=1732379290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/94994e64f8e9c8f6a5581198151ccbb1.webm?t=1732379290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/94994e64f8e9c8f6a5581198151ccbb1.mp4?t=1732379290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Craft beats, write rhymes and equip your creations to learn skills and increase your stats.",
    "about_the_game": "In Polyphony, a world governed by music, Hip Hop was once a great culture that thrived and existed for the benefit of commoners and those who were impoverished. However, soon after the &quot;Golden Age,&quot; The Evil Music Industry took over the world's music and forced those who practiced the 4 elements of Hip Hop into hiding for many years. Meanwhile, mysterious monsters known as &quot;The Darkness&quot; begin to appear around the world without explanation...<br><br>Join BeNeVoLeNcE, Mega Ran and friends on their quest to restore the 4 Elements of Hip-Hop and save the world from the evil Music Industry and the Darkness. The story of TOTE follows their adventures as they journey around the musical world of Polyphony!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/b02800a4d279431aec76c97dce73d3b8.webp?t=1732379290\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/2981e944671784c158de277e61b6a22b.poster.avif?t=1732379290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/2981e944671784c158de277e61b6a22b.webm?t=1732379290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/2981e944671784c158de277e61b6a22b.mp4?t=1732379290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fast-paced, hack and slash action combat for up to 4 players!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497960/extras/765758355fb1197146072679014246ee.webp?t=1732379290\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap